		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0BEE000000000001"]
			description: [
				"Bees need a home. A &eSugarbag Nest&r is the starter hive - sugar cane and honeycomb, no machine required."
				""
				"Wild bees drift in the world; scoop one with a Bee Cage and drop it in. It'll settle and start filling comb."
