			description: [
				"&e&lThis is the most useful thing in this chapter and almost nobody finds it.&r"
				""
				"&fDesh&r, &fOstrum&r and &fCalorite&r gate a great deal of the pack - the ME Controller, AE2 autocrafting, Powah's Niotic/Spirited/Nitro crystals and Mekanism's Elite and Ultimate circuits."
				""
				"&a&lYou do not have to keep flying back for them.&r Keep a &fSteel Bee&r beside a block of the metal and it converts:"
