				"&7- &fBlock of Calorite&r &7-> Calorite Bee"
				""
				"&e&lSo each planet costs ONE trip.&r Bring home nine ingots, press them into a block, convert a bee, and that metal is renewable and fully automatable from then on."
				""
				"&7Centrifuge the combs to get the ingots back out.&r"
